===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sed-|*-dʰlom}}
From {{inh|en|enm|sadel}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sadol}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*sadul}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sadulaz|t=saddle}}. Further etymology uncertain, perhaps from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*sod-dʰlo-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*sed-|t=to sit}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-dʰlom}} (a variant of {{m|ine-pro|*-trom|pos={{glossary|suffix}} forming {{glossary|noun}}s denoting instruments or tools}}), though the ''{{w|Oxford English Dictionary}}'' says this “presents formal difficulties”.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|1}} and ''adj.''|noformat=1|id=169618|date=June 2022|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

